---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'June 16, 2026';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | DriveClean LI"
  description="How DriveClean LI collects, uses, and protects your personal information."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:py-20">
    <p class="text-sm font-medium text-red-600">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl">
      Privacy Policy
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-500">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

    <div class="prose-policy mt-10 space-y-8 text-slate-700">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Overview</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          DriveClean Mobile Detailing ("DriveClean," "we," "us") operates drivecleanli.com and
          provides mobile car detailing services in Suffolk County, Long Island, New York. This
          policy explains what information we collect when you use our website or book a service,
          and how we use it.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Information we collect</h2>
        <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 leading-relaxed">
          <li>
            <strong>Contact and booking details</strong> — name, phone number, service address,
            appointment time, service selections, and any notes you provide when booking.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Payment information</strong> — payments are processed by Square. We do not
            store your full card number on our servers. Square provides us with payment status
            and order details needed to confirm your booking.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Address suggestions</strong> — when you search for an address, Google Places
            may process your search input to provide autocomplete results.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Basic technical data</strong> — such as browser type and pages visited, which
            our hosting provider may log for security and performance.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">How we use your information</h2>
        <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 leading-relaxed">
          <li>Schedule and fulfill your detailing appointment</li>
          <li>Send appointment-related communications, including reminders before we arrive</li>
          <li>Process payments and maintain booking records</li>
          <li>Respond to questions or support requests</li>
          <li>Improve our website and services</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Third-party services</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          We use trusted providers to run our business. These may include:
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 leading-relaxed">
          <li><strong>Square</strong> — payment processing</li>
          <li><strong>Google Calendar</strong> — scheduling and availability</li>
          <li><strong>Google Maps / Places</strong> — address autocomplete</li>
          <li><strong>Vercel</strong> — website hosting</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          Each provider has its own privacy policy governing how they handle data. We only share
          what is needed for them to perform their services.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">How long we keep information</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          We retain booking and contact information as long as needed to provide services,
          comply with legal obligations, resolve disputes, and maintain business records. Payment
          records are kept according to Square's policies and applicable law.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Your choices</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of personal information we hold,
          subject to legal and operational requirements. To make a request, contact us using the
          information below.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Children's privacy</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          Our services are not directed to children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect
          personal information from children.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          We may update this policy from time to time. The "Last updated" date at the top of this
          page will reflect the most recent revision.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Contact us</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          Questions about this privacy policy or your data:
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 leading-relaxed">
          <li>
            Email:
            <a href="mailto:services@drivecleanli.com" class="text-red-600 hover:underline">
              services@drivecleanli.com
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            Phone:
            <a href="tel:+16317645337" class="text-red-600 hover:underline">(631) 764-5337</a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>
    </div>

    <nav class="mt-12 flex flex-wrap gap-6 text-sm font-medium" aria-label="Related pages">
      <a href="/accessibility" class="text-red-600 hover:underline">Accessibility</a>
      <a href="/" class="text-red-600 hover:underline">← Back to home</a>
    </nav>
  </section>
</Layout>
